			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">That is good kid.  Great tale to hear.  However, you should visit your family.  Dispite what mistrust your father may have had against you, he still loves you deep, down in his heart somewhere.  Be glad you have a family return too.  Well those are the thoughts of this simple, yet extremely good looking, farmboy.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
-Thoral Stonesgrace of the Concordat Angelis, Emerald Warrior of Kelethin, master of the sword and taunt, sworn enemy of Prexus, devote follower of Tunare, and owner of the worlds most sparkling grin (ping)- 
