			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Greetings and well met, Darven. Although I've not Thoral's... flair.. I too, agree that your family still cares deeply for you. For your mother, that's obvious. For your father, it may not be, but I'm sure he is concerned for your well-being. Have you been back in contact with them since you left?
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Regardless, I am glad you have found your way to us. Welcome, Darven, and may we be able to further your wisdom.
<br />

<br />

<br />

