		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=9047&amp;sid=9cd88b952d3178a8692f74c36a595998#9047"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Nov 07, 2001 3:31 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=9047&amp;sid=9cd88b952d3178a8692f74c36a595998"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">M'thanks tae ye both, fer th' welcome an' th' advice.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
*chews his mustache for a moment before continuing, his thoughts and feelings waging a small battle inside him*
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
And... Aye.. I have seen me family once since I left. I've written me mum more than a time or two, an' keep her up tae date on where I be, an' wot I be doin'.... *a half-grin lifts one corner of his lips as he thinks of his mother, and then disappears as he continues* And as fer me da... Well.. He do have enough on his mind, wot with th' rest o' me siblings tae raise, an' a house tae keep up. I dinnae see him when I returned, recently, but there did be a lot tae do when I was home....  *he shrugs slightly, chewing at his mustache again* He dinnae have time fer me, an' I dinnae have time fer him.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
But that be neither here nor there! *smiles, happy again* Life be good, here, an' yer warm welcomes do make me smile!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Hunt well, my new friends, an' keep er nose tae th' wind!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
-Darven 
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
