			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Welcome aboard young one.  Sorry for the lateness of this.  Look forward to seeing you and travelling the adventures together.  
<br />
Marcelas Hiddenstrike
<br />

<br />
Scout of the Concordat<i></i><br />_________________<br />The good thing about repeating your mistakes is that you know when to duck.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
