			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Darven grins happily, his eyes bright.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
'Well, e'en a late hullo from ye be a good one, friend. An' aye, I look forward tae meetin' ye oot an' aboot, when I be able tae do so again. Seems me friends in th' Peaks have need o' me of late, an' gettin' back tae makin' new ones has tae wait a bit.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
-OOC Can't wait to play again.... I am told in a few more days, a few more days.... *sigh* A lifetime, non?
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Be well.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Darven's Creator 
<br />
<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
